---

<section id="about" class="text-cream py-28 md:py-40 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="hairline-gold max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20 md:mb-28 opacity-50"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-20">
    <div class="md:col-span-5" data-reveal>
      <div class="text-[12px] lg:text-[18px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.30em] text-gold mb-5">
        The studio
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display display-tight text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.4rem]">
        <span class="gradient-cream">A Victoria-based</span>
        <br />
        <span class="gradient-crimson italic">studio,</span>
        <br />
        <span class="gradient-cream">for businesses with</span>
        <br />
        <span class="text-cream-mute">a story to tell.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-cream-soft text-xl lg:text-[28px] leading-[1.55]" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 120ms">
      <p>
        A small business shouldn't need a big-city agency to have a website worth
        the visit, an Instagram worth following, or a catalogue worth handing to a
        customer.
      </p>
      <p>
        Anara works with cafés, boutiques, makers, tradies, wineries and service
        businesses across Australia. We meet in person or over a call. We answer
        the phone. We charge in writing, so what something costs is known before
        it begins.
      </p>
      <div class="hairline-gold my-10 opacity-50"></div>
      <p class="text-cream-mute text-base lg:text-[23px] leading-relaxed">
        The name is the Persian word for pomegranate — many seeds, many small
        beginnings. We're new, and we'd rather earn the work than pad an invoice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
